[I] Web Services Dynamic Discovery (WS-Discovery) host daemon

[T] wsdd implements a Web Service Discovery host daemon. It enables Samba (and
[T] other) hosts, such as a local NAS device, to be found by WS-Discovery
[T] clients like Windows, which no longer support the older NetBIOS/WINS based
[T] network browsing.

[U] https://github.com/christgau/wsdd

[A] Steffen Christgau
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/network
[F] CROSS

[L] MIT
[V] 0.9

[D] 769ee3eb945a53e277b5022e5c1b1cd2cef8c955724a180c76399bc3 wsdd-0.9.tar.gz https://github.com/christgau/wsdd/archive/v0.9/

runmake=0
pkg_wsdd_install() {
	install -Dm755 src/wsdd.py $root$bindir/wsdd
	install -Dm644 man/wsdd.8 $root$mandir/man8/wsdd.8
	install -Dm644 -t $root$libdir/systemd/system etc/systemd/wsdd.service
}
hook_add postmake 5 pkg_wsdd_install
